<title>JAPAN: Australia's QTC launches 5.0% eurodollar notes.</title>
<headline>Australia's QTC launches 5.0% eurodollar notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following eurodollar note issue was announced by Nikko Securities on Wednesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Queensland Treasury Corp</p>
<p> AMT		 $250 million</p>
<p> COUPON	    5.0 pct</p>
<p> MATURITY	  12 March 1998</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  12 March 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	Feb 26 to March 11</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P AA, Moody's Aa2</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Europe</p>
<p>NOTES: The eurodollar notes will be guaranteed by the state of Queensland.</p>
</text>
